        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ultrasound - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "RESONANT FREQUENCY:\nFor thickness-mode vibration (most common):\nf₀ = c_piezo / (2·t)   where t = thickness\nAt 5 MHz: t = c_PZT / (2·f) = 4000 m/s / 10⁷ = 0.4 mm"
    },
